      "observation": "Actual AC1021 import with value flags0/units0 overwrote existing TABLE masks4660/22136 instead of retaining scoped value metadata.",
      "fix": "Route scoped93/94 to existing DRW_CadValue formatFlags/unitType. Outside CELL_VALUE retain existing header assignment; nonnegative input bounds unchanged."
