      "log": "/tmp/rpp5ex-writer-fresh-red.log",
      "observation": "Fresh public plain TABLE writer accepted nonzero value format flags and replaced the destination without emitting the metadata.",
      "fix": "Preflight seven unencoded metadata categories before record publication: format flags, units, data size, format string, display string, object ID and raw bytes. Refuse atomically until an explicit full-value output path exists."
